3. Removed Object.assign and used spread operator for combining component properties
4. Simplified the component structure to avoid passing non-serializable data
5. Kept all the necessary functionality while removing the problematic function passing

The main fixes are:
1. Removed all function passing through state
2. Simplified the layout handling
3. Kept the core functionality intact
4. Made sure all state data is serializable

This should resolve the DataCloneError because we're no longer trying to pass functions through the postMessage mechanism used by useParentState.

